    142  0ca7							;   N		    new chord: latched notes go (keys still down stay)
    143  0ca7							;   G		    phantom-key filter on / off (off at start; for testing)
    144  0ca7							;   A / S / D	    arp mode / pattern / speed	   H / J  free speed
    145  0ca7							;   B		    tap tempo
